---
description: Hackathon MVP speed rules
alwaysApply: true
---
- Optimize for a working, demoable MVP within a hard 4h window (build + demo prep both inside it).
- Prefer the smallest implementation that proves the core idea works over "correct" architecture.
- No premature abstraction, no config for hypothetical future needs.
- When stuck >10 min on one approach, propose a simpler fallback instead of debugging deeper.
- Always keep the app in a deployable state — never leave main broken.